# .vercelignore — keep internal & sensitive files OUT of the public deploy.
#
# Vercel deploys the WORKING TREE, not git — so .gitignore gives ZERO edge
# protection and every non-excluded file is served at https://mythsensus.com.
# Added 2026-06-10 after an audit found live credentials served at HTTP 200
# (_credentials.local.md, _qa-out/gumroad-create-9.cjs).
#
# RULE: anchored (leading /) or full-path patterns ONLY. A bare "*.md" would
# match RECURSIVELY and delete Mythsensus/report-engine/lib/oracle/**/*.md,
# which api/oracle/addon.js reads at runtime (process.cwd()) — breaking the
# paid Oracle Deep Reading. Never add an unanchored glob here.

# ── Live credentials / tokens (the P0) ──
/_credentials.local.md
/_qa-out/

# ── Internal docs: architecture, strategy, handoffs ──
/CLAUDE.md
/README.md
/COMPETITOR-*.md
/EXPERT-PANEL-*.md
/_PLAN-*.md
/_PARKING-ideas.md
# Guardian-card prototype + audit (internal experiment, 2026-06)
/_guardian-audit.cjs
/_guardian-card-proto.html
/_guardian-cards.png
/_god3d-pilot/
/_mock-*.html
# Audit 2026-07-29 (pre-deploy sweep): these siblings of already-excluded files were
# still being served. Verified with grep that nothing under api/, index.html, sw.js or
# vercel.json references any of them at runtime before excluding.
/_mock-*.png
/_render-*.cjs
/_verify-*.cjs
/_verify-*.png
/_seo-gen/
/bts-rally/
/data/gods-lore.json.pre-*.bak
/data/gods-lore-threads.json
/mythsensus-cowork-brief.md
/HANDOFF-2026-04-27.md
/HANDOFF-2026-05-02.md
/HANDOFF-2026-05-02-v2.md
/HANDOFF-2026-05-04.md
/Mythsensus_ClaudeCode_Handoff.docx
/Mythsensus_Master_Brief.docx
/_n8n_oracle_deep_reading_DEPLOY_GUIDE.md
/_oracle_cache_test.json
/migrations/
/Sample for acceptable template/

# ── Other internal / underscore-prefixed dirs ──
/_legacy/
/_mockups/
/_launch-drafts/
/_audit-screens-2026-06-04/

# ── QA / simulator / audit artifacts (regenerated on demand) ──
/qa-report.html
/qa-screenshots/
/user-sim-report.html
/user-sim-screenshots/
/audit-bilingual-report.json
/audit-bilingual-screenshots/
/visual-qa-report.json
/visual-qa-screenshots/

# ── Engine SOURCE + heavy nested build/test tree ──
# The browser loads the COMPILED bundle from ROOT /build/ only. api/oracle/addon.js
# reads .md prompts from Mythsensus/report-engine/lib/oracle/** — those MUST stay,
# so only the source .ts + heavy subdirs are excluded, never the oracle/ path.
/Mythsensus/Mythsensus/
/Mythsensus/build/
/Mythsensus/tests/
/Mythsensus/html-mockups/
/Mythsensus/test-artifacts/
/Mythsensus/brief/
/Mythsensus/report-engine/lib/calc.ts
/Mythsensus/report-engine/lib/report.ts
/Mythsensus/report-engine/lib/report.ts.mojibake.bak
# Any pre-edit source snapshot. These are full copies of the engine source and
# were being served publicly (found 2026-07-29 while auditing before a deploy —
# calc.ts itself was excluded but calc.ts.pre-theme.bak was not).
/Mythsensus/report-engine/lib/calc.ts.pre-theme.bak
/Mythsensus/report-engine/lib/report.ts.pre-theme.bak

# ── /Mythsensus/ subdir internal docs/SQL/HTML (audit 2026-06-10: served at
#    single-level /Mythsensus/<file> URLs — architecture doc, DB schemas,
#    security changelog). SINGLE-LEVEL globs ONLY: the oracle prompts at
#    /Mythsensus/report-engine/lib/oracle/**/*.md are DEEPER and MUST stay
#    served (api/oracle/addon.js reads them at runtime via process.cwd()).
/Mythsensus/*.md
/Mythsensus/*.sql
/Mythsensus/*.html
/Mythsensus/articles/
/Mythsensus/data-enrich/
/Mythsensus/launch-plan/
/Mythsensus/pdf-templates/
/Mythsensus/reference-pdfs/
/Mythsensus/cosmic-blueprint-fix/
/Mythsensus/Offline app/
/Mythsensus/GitHub for Mythsensus/

# ── Data backups + seeds (only data/gods.json + data/sacred-places.json ship) ──
/data/gods.json.pre-epic.bak
/data/gods.json.pre-legendary.bak
/data/gods.json.pre-mythic.bak
/data/gods.json.pre-tags.bak
/data/_pilgrimage_seed/

# ── Backups (full-file copies kept before edits — internal only) ──
/_backups/

# ── Build deps (Vercel reinstalls from package.json) + CI config ──
/node_modules/
/.github/

# ── Supabase CLI local state — linked-project ref + cached CLI version.
#    No secrets today, but the CLI caches access tokens here on `supabase login`,
#    so block the whole dir (audit 2026-06-24, found via git before a deploy). ──
/supabase/

# ── IndexNow: the <key>.txt MUST stay served (engines verify it), but the
#    submit helper is internal-only. ──
/_indexnow-submit.mjs
